WEBVTT

00:01.357 --> 00:04.290
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:04.357 --> 00:10.857
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:10.924 --> 00:13.857
French narrator:
Ah, behold the migration
法语解说员：
啊，看迁移

00:13.924 --> 00:15.857
of the majestic clams.
[clams cawing]
雄伟的蛤蜊。
[蛤蜊叫声]

00:15.924 --> 00:19.224
In search of warmer climates,
and plentiful food.
为了寻找温暖的气候，
和充足的食物。

00:19.290 --> 00:20.824
[cawing continues]
[叫声继续]

00:20.890 --> 00:22.557
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

00:22.624 --> 00:24.557
narrator: The clams
have begun to signal each other.
叙述者：蛤蜊
已经开始互相发出信号。

00:24.624 --> 00:27.257
A hospitable location
has been found.
热情好客的地点
已被发现。

00:27.324 --> 00:29.257
The grace they exhibit
is truly--
他们所展现的优雅
确实是——

00:29.324 --> 00:30.257
Zut alors!
Zut alors！
Zut alors！
Zut alors！
Zut alors！
Zut alors！
Zut alors！
Zut alors！

00:30.324 --> 00:31.790
Dive! Dive!
潜水！潜水！

00:31.857 --> 00:33.524
[clams cawing]
[蛤蜊叫声]

00:33.590 --> 00:35.990
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

00:36.057 --> 00:37.657
- Wow!
- 哇！

00:37.724 --> 00:39.924
- What are you doing, SpongeBob?
- [surprised yelling]
- 海绵宝宝，你在做什么？
- [惊讶的叫喊]

00:39.990 --> 00:42.390
I'm just checking out
the beautiful clams.
我刚刚查看
美丽的蛤蜊。

00:42.524 --> 00:44.990
Did you know
it's migration season?
你知道吗
现在是迁徙季节吗？

00:45.057 --> 00:47.857
- Yeah, I know.
- 是的，我知道。

00:47.924 --> 00:50.124
bawling]
嚎叫]

00:50.190 --> 00:52.257
I don't know!
我不知道！

00:52.324 --> 00:55.124
I lied to you!
[whimpering]
我骗了你！
[呜咽]

00:55.190 --> 00:57.124
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

00:57.190 --> 00:59.057
- Patrick, it's okay!
- 帕特里克，没关系！

00:59.124 --> 01:01.590
- [whimpers]
Okay.
- [呜咽]
好的。

01:01.657 --> 01:04.124
- Do you need to blow your nose?
- 你需要擤鼻涕吗？

01:04.190 --> 01:06.124
- [burbling blows]
- [颤抖的打击]

01:06.190 --> 01:08.724
You're a good friend.
你是个好朋友。

01:08.790 --> 01:10.390
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

01:10.524 --> 01:13.057
- So can I see the clams?
- 那我可以看看蛤蜊吗？

01:13.124 --> 01:14.857
- Sure! Here, use these.
- 当然！在这里，使用这些。

01:14.924 --> 01:16.257
- Thanks!
- 谢谢！

01:16.324 --> 01:18.790
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:18.857 --> 01:20.057
Hey!
嘿！

01:20.124 --> 01:23.057
[panicked straining]
[惊慌失措]

01:23.124 --> 01:24.990
[choking]
- Patrick!
[窒息]
- 帕特里克！

01:25.057 --> 01:27.990
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

01:28.057 --> 01:29.390
- Phew!
- 唷！

01:29.524 --> 01:31.057
Maybe we better
just use our eyes.
也许我们更好
只要用我们的眼睛。

01:31.124 --> 01:32.990
- Good idea.
- 好主意。

01:33.057 --> 01:33.990
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:34.057 --> 01:39.257
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:39.324 --> 01:41.424
[clam chirping]
- Ooh!
[蛤蜊鸣叫]
- 哦！

01:41.524 --> 01:43.590
Clams are so pretty!
蛤蜊真漂亮！

01:43.657 --> 01:46.290
- Just look at all those
majestic species!
- 看看所有这些
雄伟的物种！

01:46.357 --> 01:48.290
There's the Soft Shell Clam.
这里有软壳蛤。

01:48.357 --> 01:49.890
- [yawns]
Hmm.
- [哈欠]
嗯。

01:49.957 --> 01:51.690
- The Hard Shell Clam.
- 硬壳蛤。

01:51.757 --> 01:52.957
[clangs]
[叮当声]

01:53.024 --> 01:55.157
The Giant Clam.
[brakes screeching]
巨蛤。
[刹车声]

01:55.224 --> 01:57.157
- Come on! Get out of the way!
- 快点！走开!

01:57.224 --> 01:58.824
[growls]
[munches]
[咆哮]
[咀嚼]

01:58.890 --> 02:00.624
- Even a Razor Clam.
- 甚至是蛏子。

02:00.690 --> 02:03.524
- Just clean me up, as usual.
- 像往常一样，把我清理干净。

02:03.557 --> 02:06.524
[clam whirring]
[蛤蜊呼呼]

02:06.557 --> 02:10.557
- [bewildered laughter]
I'm beautiful!
- [困惑的笑声]
我很美丽！

02:10.624 --> 02:12.424
- Aw, I wish the clams
were closer to us
- 哦，我希望有蛤蜊
离我们更近

02:12.524 --> 02:13.757
so we could get a better look.
这样我们就可以看得更清楚。

02:13.824 --> 02:16.090
[both burbling]
Wait! I know!
[两者都在咕噜咕噜地响]
等等！我知道！

02:16.157 --> 02:18.824
They're always hungry
when they migrate!
他们总是很饿
当他们迁移时！

02:18.890 --> 02:21.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:21.557 --> 02:24.524
[happy humming]
[快乐哼哼]

02:24.557 --> 02:25.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:25.557 --> 02:28.024
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

02:28.090 --> 02:29.524
- [happy humming]
- [快乐的哼唱]

02:29.557 --> 02:31.524
- [slurping]
- [gasps]
- [发出声音]
- [喘气]

02:31.557 --> 02:33.524
Patrick, the patties
are for the clams!
帕特里克，馅饼
是为了蛤蜊！

02:33.557 --> 02:35.357
- I'm sorry, SpongeBob.
- 对不起，海绵宝宝。

02:35.424 --> 02:37.090
[munches]
[咀嚼]

02:37.157 --> 02:38.557
[slurps]
- Patrick!
[啜饮]
- 帕特里克！

02:38.624 --> 02:40.757
- What? I'm not perfect.
- 什么？我并不完美。

02:40.824 --> 02:42.257
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:42.324 --> 02:43.990
But I am full.
但我已经饱了。

02:44.057 --> 02:45.057
Nap time!
午睡时间！

02:45.124 --> 02:46.390
[snoring]
[打鼾]

02:46.524 --> 02:47.857
- Aw.
[chuckles]
- 噢。
[笑声]

02:47.924 --> 02:52.724
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:52.790 --> 02:53.890
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:53.957 --> 02:56.890
[clams squawking]
[蛤蜊嘎嘎叫]

02:56.957 --> 02:58.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:58.557 --> 03:00.190
It's working!
它正在工作！

03:00.257 --> 03:02.057
[gasping]
[喘气]

03:02.124 --> 03:03.390
Huh?
啊？

03:03.524 --> 03:06.390
- [snoring]
[cute chirping]
- [打鼾]
[可爱的叽叽喳喳声]

03:06.524 --> 03:08.190
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:08.257 --> 03:10.524
- Isn't that beautiful?
- 那不是很漂亮吗？

03:10.590 --> 03:13.224
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:13.290 --> 03:15.724
-  What is in a Squidward?
- 章鱼哥里有什么？

03:15.790 --> 03:18.524
A Squidward
by any other name would--
章鱼哥
任何其他名字都会——

03:18.590 --> 03:20.390
[loud squawking]
[大声尖叫]

03:20.524 --> 03:22.757
[groans]
Uh. Where was I?
[呻吟]
呃。我当时在哪儿？

03:22.824 --> 03:24.090
Ah, yes!
啊，是的！

03:24.157 --> 03:27.090
A Squidward, dancing fast,
乌贼王，舞姿飞快，

03:27.157 --> 03:28.957
moving like grace it--
像恩典一样移动——

03:29.024 --> 03:31.757
[loud squawking]
Oh, that is it!
[大声尖叫]
哦，就是这样！

03:31.824 --> 03:34.957
Will you clams clam up!
蛤蜊你会不会蛤蜊！

03:35.024 --> 03:36.290
[disgusted groan]
[厌恶的呻吟]

03:36.357 --> 03:38.090
[clams chirping]
[蛤蜊鸣叫]

03:38.157 --> 03:41.624
Oh, look at what the clams
are doing to my beautiful home!
哦，看看蛤蜊是什么
正在为我美丽的家园做事！

03:41.690 --> 03:45.224
SpongeBob, will you stop
feeding those clams!
海绵宝宝，你能停下来吗
喂那些蛤蜊！

03:45.290 --> 03:46.424
- Why, Squidward?
- 为什么，章鱼哥？

03:46.524 --> 03:48.290
- Because they're making a me--
- 因为他们正在塑造一个我--

03:48.357 --> 03:49.957
Agh! Stop!
啊啊！停止！

03:50.024 --> 03:52.024
- Maybe I have been
feeding these clams too much.
-也许我曾经是
喂这些蛤蜊太多了。

03:52.090 --> 03:54.357
[Squidward groaning]
[章鱼哥的呻吟声]

03:54.424 --> 03:57.557
[sobs]
I'll never be clean again!
[抽泣]
我再也不会干净了！

03:57.624 --> 03:59.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:59.557 --> 04:01.290
- * Walking to work
ain't too shabby! *
- * 步行去上班
是不是太破旧了！ *

04:01.357 --> 04:03.524
* 'Cause I'll be whipping up
a Krabby Patty!
*因为我会兴奋起来
蟹肉饼！

04:03.557 --> 04:05.190
[clams cawing]
Huh?
[蛤蜊叫声]
啊？

04:05.257 --> 04:06.324
[cawing stops]
[叫声停止]

04:06.390 --> 04:08.324
[cawing continues]
[叫声继续]

04:08.390 --> 04:09.657
Go on home, you clams!
回家吧，蛤蜊们！

04:09.724 --> 04:11.124
I have to go to work now.
我现在得去上班了。

04:11.190 --> 04:12.724
Go on. Go home.
继续。回家吧。

04:12.790 --> 04:14.724
I don't have anymore
Krabby Patties for you.
我没有了
蟹肉饼给你。

04:14.790 --> 04:16.124
You need to find your own food.
你需要找到自己的食物。

04:16.190 --> 04:18.257
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:18.324 --> 04:20.524
Okay then. I'll just--
那么好吧。我就——

04:20.590 --> 04:22.857
[panting]
[clams cawing]
[气喘吁吁]
[蛤蜊叫声]

04:22.924 --> 04:25.524
[giggles]
Oh! Follow the leader!
[咯咯笑]
哦！听从领队！

04:25.524 --> 04:32.757
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:39.224 --> 04:40.624
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

04:40.690 --> 04:42.557
Bye! I'll see you
crazy clams later.
再见！我会见到你
稍后疯狂蛤蜊。

04:42.624 --> 04:44.090
[clam caws]
[蛤叫声]

04:44.157 --> 04:45.690
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:45.757 --> 04:47.224
- Hey, that's mine!
- 嘿，那是我的！

04:47.290 --> 04:48.624
[growling]
[咆哮]

04:48.690 --> 04:50.624
[screaming]
- What are you doing?
[尖叫]
- 你在做什么？

04:50.690 --> 04:53.224
You know it's not nice
to steal people's food!
你知道这不好
偷别人的食物！

04:53.290 --> 04:54.557
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

04:54.624 --> 04:56.090
Aw, don't worry.
噢，别担心。

04:56.157 --> 04:58.090
I see that we understand
each other completely now.
我发现我们明白了
彼此现在完全了。

04:58.157 --> 05:01.290
[panicked screaming]
[clams crunching]
[惊慌尖叫]
[蛤蜊嘎吱作响]

05:01.357 --> 05:04.990
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:05.057 --> 05:06.324
No! Bad clam!
不！蛤蜊坏了！

05:06.390 --> 05:09.324
Sorry, sir!
- Blagh.
对不起，先生！
- 布拉。

05:09.524 --> 05:10.724
- What am I going to do?
- 我要做什么？

05:10.790 --> 05:12.990
I can't leave the clams alone.
我不能丢下蛤蜊不管。

05:13.057 --> 05:14.590
They'll just have to go
to work with me.
他们只需要离开
和我一起工作。

05:14.657 --> 05:16.590
Come on, you clams!
[claws squawking]
来吧，蛤蜊们！
[爪子嘎嘎作响]

05:16.657 --> 05:19.590
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

05:19.657 --> 05:22.590
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:22.657 --> 05:23.657
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

05:23.724 --> 05:25.390
[panicked screaming]
[惊慌尖叫]

05:25.524 --> 05:26.724
No! Not again!
不！不会再有！

05:26.790 --> 05:28.524
I just got clean!
我刚刚干净了！

05:28.590 --> 05:30.524
[panicked screaming]
[惊慌尖叫]

05:30.590 --> 05:33.057
- Remember, no stealing food.
- 记住，不要偷食物。

05:33.124 --> 05:34.590
[consensual caws]
[双方同意的叫声]

05:34.657 --> 05:37.190
- Perch here and be
good clams while I work.
- 栖息于此
我工作时吃蛤蜊很好。

05:37.257 --> 05:40.390
[tense swell]
[panicked screaming]
[紧张膨胀]
[惊慌尖叫]

05:40.524 --> 05:44.324
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:44.390 --> 05:45.657
- [yells]
- [大喊]

05:45.724 --> 05:48.657
[clams crunching]
[screaming]
[蛤蜊嘎吱作响]
[尖叫]

05:48.724 --> 05:51.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:51.524 --> 05:53.524
What the barnacle
is going on here?
什么藤壶
这是怎么回事？

05:53.590 --> 05:55.857
How did all these clams
get inside?
这些蛤蜊是怎么来的
进去吗？

05:55.924 --> 05:57.524
- I couldn't leave them outside.
- 我不能把他们留在外面。

05:57.590 --> 05:59.857
They were stealing
people's Krabby Patties.
他们在偷窃
人们的蟹肉饼。

05:59.924 --> 06:02.724
- Well, what do you think
they're doing in here?
- 嗯，你觉得怎么样
他们在这里做什么？

06:02.790 --> 06:04.590
- Uh, stealing
people's Krabby Patties?
- 呃，偷窃
人们的蟹肉饼？

06:04.657 --> 06:06.590
- And costing me money!
- 还花了我钱！

06:06.657 --> 06:08.590
Now get them out of here, boy!
现在让他们离开这里，孩子！

06:08.657 --> 06:11.190
[clam chirping]
[蛤蜊鸣叫]

06:11.257 --> 06:12.690
Ow!
- Bad clam!
噢！
- 蛤蜊坏了！

06:12.757 --> 06:14.890
Don't spit pearls
at nice Mr. Krabs!
别吐珍珠
在好心的蟹老板那里！

06:14.957 --> 06:16.557
- Pearls?
- 珍珠？

06:16.624 --> 06:18.557
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:18.624 --> 06:19.757
Ooh!
哦！

06:19.824 --> 06:20.924
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

06:20.990 --> 06:22.657
- Don't worry, Mr. Krabs.
- 别担心，蟹老板。

06:22.724 --> 06:24.657
I'll get all these clams
out of here right now.
我会得到所有这些蛤蜊
现在就离开这里。

06:24.724 --> 06:26.524
[clam squawks]
[蛤蜊的叫声]

06:26.524 --> 06:28.957
- Not so fast, SpongeBob.
- 别那么快，海绵宝宝。

06:29.024 --> 06:31.224
What's your hurry?
[chuckles]
你急什么？
[笑声]

06:31.290 --> 06:33.024
- Didn't you just tell me
to get the clams out of here
- 你刚才不是告诉我了吗
把蛤蜊带出这里

06:33.090 --> 06:34.890
'cause they're stealing food
from your customers?
因为他们偷食物
来自您的客户？

06:34.957 --> 06:37.890
[claws squawking]
[customers jittering]
[爪子嘎嘎作响]
[顾客紧张]

06:37.957 --> 06:39.757
- Ow! Forget the customers.
- 噢！忘记顾客吧。

06:39.824 --> 06:42.224
If these clams keep
spitting pearls at me,
如果这些蛤蜊保留
向我吐珍珠，

06:42.290 --> 06:43.624
I'll be rich!
我会变得富有！

06:43.690 --> 06:44.890
Good clams.
好蛤蜊。

06:44.957 --> 06:46.757
Good clams! Tee-hee-hee.
好蛤蜊！嘻嘻嘻。

06:46.824 --> 06:48.290
Oh.
[groans]
哦。
[呻吟]

06:48.357 --> 06:50.090
[grunts]
Bad clams!
[咕哝]
蛤蜊坏了！

06:50.157 --> 06:52.090
Stupid clams!
Smelly clams!
愚蠢的蛤蜊！
臭蛤蜊！

06:52.157 --> 06:54.290
Ow! Ow! Ooh!
Ah! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！哦！
啊!噢！噢！

06:54.357 --> 06:56.224
[enchanting crescendo]
[迷人的渐强]

06:56.290 --> 06:57.624
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:57.690 --> 06:59.324
- I've gotta get
these clams out of here!
- 我必须得到
这些蛤蜊离开这里！

06:59.390 --> 07:01.190
Follow me, clams.
跟我来吧，蛤蜊。

07:01.257 --> 07:03.190
[clams squawking]
[蛤蜊嘎嘎叫]

07:03.257 --> 07:04.790
- Wait! SpongeBob!
- 等待！海绵宝宝！

07:04.857 --> 07:07.524
Come back with those
crummy clams!
带着那些回来
糟糕的蛤蜊！

07:07.590 --> 07:09.590
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:09.657 --> 07:11.324
Whoa!
哇！

07:11.390 --> 07:14.524
- I figured if I tire them out,
maybe they'll behave better.
- 我想如果我把他们累坏了
也许他们会表现得更好。

07:14.590 --> 07:17.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:17.590 --> 07:19.857
Let's go, clams.
Good boys!
我们走吧，蛤蜊。
好孩子们！

07:19.924 --> 07:21.724
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:21.790 --> 07:22.724
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:22.790 --> 07:23.790
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:23.857 --> 07:24.924
- Are you Steven?
- 你是史蒂文吗？

07:24.990 --> 07:26.524
- [affirmative squawk]
- [肯定的尖叫声]

07:26.524 --> 07:28.257
- Oh, thank goodness!
- 哦，谢天谢地！

07:28.324 --> 07:30.724
I'm so new to this
online dating thing.
我对此很陌生
网上约会的事情。

07:30.790 --> 07:33.524
I'm always afraid
the guy won't show up!
我总是害怕
那家伙不会出现！

07:33.590 --> 07:35.024
- [naughty growl]
- [顽皮的咆哮]

07:35.090 --> 07:38.890
- Oh!
You silver tongued devil you!
- 哦！
你这个三寸不烂之舌的恶魔！

07:38.957 --> 07:40.357
[gasps]
- There you are!
[喘气]
- 你来了！

07:40.424 --> 07:43.057
No dawdling now, come on.
现在不磨蹭了，加油。

07:43.124 --> 07:44.590
- Call me!
- 打电话给我！

07:44.657 --> 07:47.590
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

07:47.657 --> 07:49.857
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:49.924 --> 07:51.790
[growls]
- [yells]
[咆哮]
- [大喊]

07:51.857 --> 07:54.257
[munches]
- Whoa!
[咀嚼]
- 哇！

07:54.324 --> 07:59.324
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:59.390 --> 08:01.524
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:01.590 --> 08:03.324
- Hey, there you are.
- 嘿，你来了。

08:03.390 --> 08:04.857
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:04.924 --> 08:06.657
No, no pushing!
不，不许推！

08:06.724 --> 08:08.357
We share the swing.
我们一起荡秋千。

08:08.424 --> 08:10.357
Like this.
Just watch.
像这样。
就看吧。

08:10.424 --> 08:12.524
[swing squeaking]
[摇摆吱吱声]

08:12.590 --> 08:14.057
Whee!
哎哟！

08:14.124 --> 08:17.124
Whoo-whoo-whoo-whoo-whoo-whoo!
[giggling]
呼-呼-呼-呼-呼-呼！
[咯咯笑]

08:17.190 --> 08:18.457
- There you are!
- 你来了！

08:18.524 --> 08:19.690
- Oh, hey, Squidward.
- 哦，嘿，章鱼哥。

08:19.757 --> 08:21.390
- Don't,
"Oh, hey, Squidward" me!
- 别，
“哦，嘿，章鱼哥”我！

08:21.457 --> 08:24.324
Not after you lured
these monsters into town.
不是在你引诱之后
这些怪物进城了。

08:24.390 --> 08:28.390
They are a menace to society
and we want them out!
他们对社会构成威胁
我们希望他们离开！

08:28.457 --> 08:30.190
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

08:30.257 --> 08:32.190
- I'm sorry
the clams messed things up,
- 对不起
蛤蜊把事情搞砸了，

08:32.257 --> 08:35.190
but you must remember,
they're wild animals.
但你必须记住，
他们是野生动物。

08:35.257 --> 08:38.190
[menacing growls]
[威胁的咆哮]

08:38.257 --> 08:39.990
- Exactly!
- 确切地！

08:40.057 --> 08:44.790
And wild animals don't belong
in a civilized town!
野生动物不属于
在文明城镇！

08:44.857 --> 08:47.390
[clamoring in agreement]
[大声表示同意]

08:47.457 --> 08:48.890
- Oh, maybe you're right.
- 哦，也许你是对的。

08:48.957 --> 08:50.690
If you really want
the clams gone,
如果你真的想要
蛤蜊不见了，

08:50.757 --> 08:52.324
then I'll lead them out of town.
然后我会带他们出城。

08:52.390 --> 08:57.190
- In that case, let me just
say this from the heart.
- 既然这样，我就
发自内心地说这句话。

08:57.257 --> 09:00.724
Give me more pearls,
you stupid, smelly clams!
给我更多的珍珠，
你这个又蠢又臭的蛤蜊！

09:00.790 --> 09:02.590
[clams squawking]
[蛤蜊嘎嘎叫]

09:02.657 --> 09:04.124
[thuds]
[重击声]

09:04.190 --> 09:05.924
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:05.990 --> 09:08.924
- Well, then,
I guess this is good-bye.
- 那么，
我想这就是再见了。

09:08.990 --> 09:12.190
[melancholy violin playing]
[忧郁的小提琴演奏]

09:12.257 --> 09:14.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:14.590 --> 09:17.224
[Tarzan yell]
[泰山大喊]

09:17.290 --> 09:18.524
[imitating clams]
【模仿蛤蜊】

09:18.557 --> 09:19.824
[clams squawking]
[蛤蜊嘎嘎叫]

09:19.890 --> 09:21.824
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

09:21.890 --> 09:23.824
[imitating clams cawing]
【模仿蛤蜊叫声】

09:23.890 --> 09:25.824
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

09:25.890 --> 09:28.357
[clams cawing]
[蛤蜊叫声]

09:28.424 --> 09:30.690
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:30.757 --> 09:32.690
all: Huh?
[screaming]
全体：啊？
[尖叫]

09:32.757 --> 09:35.690
[cawing]
[slurping]
[啼叫]
[发出声音]

09:35.757 --> 09:37.557
[sea bears growling]
[海熊咆哮]

09:37.624 --> 09:39.557
[panicking cawing]
[惊慌的叫声]

09:39.624 --> 09:43.057
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:43.124 --> 09:45.757
[electricity zapping]
[电击]

09:45.824 --> 09:47.924
[thuds]
Oh!
[重击声]
哦！

09:49.890 --> 09:52.324
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

09:52.390 --> 09:54.857
- Oh, the life
of a clam is the best!
- 哦，生活
蛤蜊是最好的！

09:54.924 --> 09:57.057
[laughing]
[笑]

09:57.124 --> 09:59.524
[shivering]
Getting cold out.
[发抖]
出去冷了。

09:59.524 --> 10:00.790
Must be fall.
一定是秋天。

10:00.857 --> 10:02.124
[wind howls]
[风嚎]

10:02.190 --> 10:04.057
I hate to say it,
little clams,
我讨厌这么说
小蛤蜊，

10:04.124 --> 10:06.524
but it's time for you all
to fly home to warmer climates.
但现在是你们所有人的时候了
飞回气候温暖的家。

10:06.524 --> 10:08.857
[clams chirping]
[蛤蜊鸣叫]

10:08.924 --> 10:10.524
Don't be sad.
别伤心。

10:10.524 --> 10:12.657
We'll see each other next year.
I promise.
我们明年再见。
我保证。

10:12.724 --> 10:14.257
Now go on.
现在继续。

10:14.324 --> 10:17.424
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:17.524 --> 10:19.157
The circle of life.
生活的圈子。

10:19.224 --> 10:21.524
Whelp, guess I should
migrate home, too.
呃，我想我应该
也移民回家吧

10:21.590 --> 10:23.024
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:23.090 --> 10:24.824
- Well,
it took me a whole season,
- 嗯，
我花了整整一个赛季的时间

10:24.890 --> 10:27.290
but it's finally clean.
但终于干净了。

10:27.357 --> 10:29.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:29.557 --> 10:31.757
The clams! They're back!
蛤蜊！他们回来了！

10:31.824 --> 10:32.824
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:32.890 --> 10:34.157
[splashes]
[飞溅]

10:34.224 --> 10:35.824
- Oh, wait, Squidward.
It's just me!
- 哦，等等，章鱼哥。
这只是我！

10:35.890 --> 10:37.224
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:37.290 --> 10:39.557
- [panicked grunts]
Drool pool!
- [惊慌的咕哝声]
口水池！

10:39.624 --> 10:42.557
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:42.624 --> 10:43.890
- What'd I miss?
- 我错过了什么？

10:43.957 --> 10:45.757
[yelling]
[大喊]

10:45.824 --> 10:48.524
[both shouting and screaming]
[又喊又叫]

10:48.524 --> 10:50.524
- Okay, have fun, you two.
- 好吧，你们两个玩得开心。

10:50.524 --> 10:52.524
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:52.524 --> 10:54.624
It sure is nice to be home.
回家真是太好了。

10:54.690 --> 10:56.924
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:59.657 --> 11:02.590
[playful ukulele music]
[俏皮的尤克里里音乐]

11:02.657 --> 11:09.957
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:19.724 --> 11:26.957
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:36.724 --> 11:41.157
* *
**
**
**

**